      <div class="cs2-eyebrow">Confidential professional services case study</div>
      <h1>6 qualified meetings. 3 serious opportunities. <span class="highlight">1 new client in 90 days.</span></h1>
      <p class="cs2-lead">A professional services provider needed a repeatable way to reach companies with a credible reason to consider outside expertise. The campaign turned operating changes into careful questions, qualified the delivery fit, and created conversations the service team could continue.</p>
      <div class="cs2-note"><i></i> Professional services · Human cold calling · B2B lead generation</div>
    </div>

